{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"herb_patch","model_identifier":"herb_patch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# herb_patch\n\nWild herb patch: a clump of medicinal herbs with small white and yellow flowers, about 1 m across.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -19..17, y 0..14, z -17..19 units (1.00 x 0.41 x 1.00 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 90.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 36 x 14 x 36 (w x h x d), centred at x -1, z 1\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): ready to pick\n- `picked`: same as `herb_patch_picked`: cut-down green stubs, no flowers\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"herb0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.75,0.0,-6.75],"to":[-9.25,9.0,-5.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18.25,0.0,19.75,9.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20.25,0.0,21.75,9.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18.25,0.0,19.75,9.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[20.25,0.0,21.75,9.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.25,40.25,5.75,41.75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.25,40.25,5.75,41.75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"6b0fde6e-8b6d-546a-8664-1e3f94da075d"},{"name":"herb0_leaf0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.25,2.7,-7.25],"to":[-5.25,3.7,-4.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[50.75,26.3,54.75,27.3],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50.75,34.3,53.25,35.3],"textu